  dialogues:
  - text: Goodday, lad. How can we help you?
    npcId: straw
  - text: Ah, the anual river dredging. As every year, we will convince people on
      doing it.
    npcId: straw
  - text: But as my observation, the river is silted pretty bad this year, the work
      will be tough. No wonder why Tarren feel so worried.
    npcId: brick
  - text: I'll try to give people something to make them into this job.
    npcId: brick
